OL,3,GNEWSAPolice had councillor's
OL,4,Afingerprints on hate mail - but dropped
OL,5,Acase
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice had fingerprint evidence linking
OL,8,Fa high-profile councillor to a poison
OL,9,Fpen letter up to 12 months before he
OL,10,Fwent on to target another politician in
OL,11,Fa "persistent and wicked" hate mail
OL,12,Fcampaign.
OL,14,FWell-known Liverpool anti-poverty
OL,15,Fcampaigner Gerard Woodhouse, 63, was
OL,16,Fgiven a community order last year for
OL,17,Fharassing ex-Lord Mayor Christine Banks
OL,18,F` who he had known for 50 years ` with
OL,19,Fanonymous letters and cards in the post
OL,20,Fbetween 2023 and 2025.
