OL,3,GNEWSAPolice had councillor's
OL,4,Afingerprints on hate mail - but dropped
OL,5,Acase
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the BBC has learned that although
OL,8,Fan investigation that pre-dated his
OL,9,Fhate campaign against Labour colleague
OL,10,FBanks yielded fingerprint evidence from
OL,11,Fa letter sent to a housing association
OL,12,Fboss, the inquiry was stood down
OL,13,Fbecause officers were "unable to
OL,14,Festablish contact" with the alleged
OL,15,Fvictim after she left her job.
OL,17,FDespite reopening the case earlier this
OL,18,Fyear, police have now had to drop it
OL,19,Fbecause the time limit for prosecuting
OL,20,Fharassment allegations has expired.
